    "name": "Bloody Painter Dating Sim",
    "steam_appid": 3214880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an official romantic horror visual novel game created to celebrate the 10th anniversary of the character from 'Bloody Painter' and to give back to the fans for their support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a spin-off based on the 2017 version of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214880/extras/750d88482384e5465a79223f2fca75ad.poster.avif?t=1741082726\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214880/extras/750d88482384e5465a79223f2fca75ad.webm?t=1741082726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214880/extras/750d88482384e5465a79223f2fca75ad.mp4?t=1741082726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have unfortunately been captured by a serial killer, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and you must increase your chances of survival within seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will determine how he treats you and the outcome of your relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will your final relationship with him be...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will there be a change in the relationship between the killer and his prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT WARNINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eThis game contains some graphic scenes of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eIf you encounter a murderer, please call the police first.It's unrealistic to develop a romantic relationship with a murderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eThis is a romance game\u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eFully voiced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eThere are a total of 14 CG illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESTIMATED PLAY TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 minutes for an good ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NUMBER OF ENDINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 bad endings + 4 good endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STREAMING PERMISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream and play this game live! If you encounter any bugs, please leave a comment to let us know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players choosing the English language, it is recommended to go to settings and adjust the speed to the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPERATING SYSTEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows 7 and above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development. Story. Programming by \u8fea\u9e7fDeluCat @DeluCatOfficial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics by \u725b\u5976 @milk890522</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background Art by kurumi2179\u3001\u8fea\u9e7fDeluCat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logotype by \u30b5\u30e4\u30ab@laipeng16</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Acting by Easton@eastonandemmary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer by ZAO@ZAO_Studio_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font by \u7ff0\u5b57\u9444\u9020 - TaipeiSansTCBeta-Regular</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Thanks to \u5357\u7fc1\u3001LoS-Light</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Teste by \u4e03\u4e03</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an official romantic horror visual novel game created to celebrate the 10th anniversary of the character from 'Bloody Painter' and to give back to the fans for their support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a spin-off based on the 2017 version of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214880/extras/750d88482384e5465a79223f2fca75ad.poster.avif?t=1741082726\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214880/extras/750d88482384e5465a79223f2fca75ad.webm?t=1741082726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214880/extras/750d88482384e5465a79223f2fca75ad.mp4?t=1741082726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have unfortunately been captured by a serial killer, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and you must increase your chances of survival within seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will determine how he treats you and the outcome of your relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will your final relationship with him be...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will there be a change in the relationship between the killer and his prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT WARNINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eThis game contains some graphic scenes of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eIf you encounter a murderer, please call the police first.It's unrealistic to develop a romantic relationship with a murderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eThis is a romance game\u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eFully voiced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0eThere are a total of 14 CG illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESTIMATED PLAY TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 minutes for an good ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NUMBER OF ENDINGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 bad endings + 4 good endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STREAMING PERMISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream and play this game live! If you encounter any bugs, please leave a comment to let us know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players choosing the English language, it is recommended to go to settings and adjust the speed to the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPERATING SYSTEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows 7 and above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development. Story. Programming by \u8fea\u9e7fDeluCat @DeluCatOfficial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics by \u725b\u5976 @milk890522</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background Art by kurumi2179\u3001\u8fea\u9e7fDeluCat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logotype by \u30b5\u30e4\u30ab@laipeng16</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Acting by Easton@eastonandemmary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer by ZAO@ZAO_Studio_</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font by \u7ff0\u5b57\u9444\u9020 - TaipeiSansTCBeta-Regular</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Thanks to \u5357\u7fc1\u3001LoS-Light</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Teste by \u4e03\u4e03</p>",
    "short_description": "You have unfortunately been captured by a serial killer, and you must increase your chances of survival within seven days. Your choices will determine how he treats you and the outcome of your relationship. What will your final relationship with him be...?",
